WEBVTT

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.680
Excuse me!

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.250
Coming through!

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.480
Hold it right there!

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.110
I said hold it!

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.830
There.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.500
Stop! Stop!

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.180
A sad display...

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:21.310
You allowed a lowly soldier to humiliate you.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.020
I just... had a bit of trouble...

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:26.270
Silence!

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:28.330
Second Lieutenant Robin.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:31.860
Do you know who's paying your wages?

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.290
This country's taxpayers.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.300
Don't you feel that you owe

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:39.700
an apology to the hardworking 
citizens of this country?

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.370
They would have been better off 
keeping their money in a piggy bank.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:48.120
However, Sergeant Major 
Egret performed admirably.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.220
Allow me to award you a mochi later.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:52.170
Captain...

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:56.540
<i>Curse you, man with the gas mask!</i>

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:59.460
<i>The next time we meet, I will make you pay!</i>

