00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:22.700
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.250
Let's do this, Kate!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.430
Today's the day conquest is achieved!

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.160
Yes, I know.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:50.350
Today's the day I pull off a back hip circle!

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.250
That's nice and all,

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.150
but why do we have to sit here and watch?

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.350
Good grief.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.850
Don't you understand that 
I'm saving everyone time

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:03.830
by holding our meeting at the 
same time as morning training?

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.460
You're the only one that benefits from that!

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:14.910
Ah, them.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:17.510
They've finally been 
sent to the front lines.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:20.880
I figured they'd serve as 
nothing more than comic relief,

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.690
but they turned out to be pretty strong.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:26.600
Uh, who are these people anyway?

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:28.450
White Light.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.120
A secret defense organization 
that's the modern counterpart of

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.450
the special agency Byakkou, 
which was formed in the Meiji period.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.990
You can trace its roots 
all the way back to the

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:42.720
Bureau of Onmyou in the Ministry of 
Central Affairs during the Asuka period.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.340
Sounds really made-up now.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.970
The majority of their members 
are girls in their early teens.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:54.050
Their equipment is armed with what 
appears to be artificial Onmyou power,

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.040
and during the previous battle...

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.230
Yeah, I've heard enough.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.240
It's a waste of time to take them seriously.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:02.030
More importantly, right now,

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.430
we should talk about her.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.360
What?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.850
Er, but she's...

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.680
White Robin.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.120
I have her classified as 
a Shiba Inu class warrior.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.770
Don't underestimate her strength!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.400
After all, she took me out with one bl—

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.770
You don't count.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.820
It's just Yasu.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:22.760
Indeed.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.120
Okay! Lookin' good, Kate!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.660
You can do this!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.770
Keep it up!

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.850
The key is to never give up!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:43.480
I-I have to say that a klutz like her 
should not be considered a threat...

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:48.360
But my little girl instinct 
tells me that she's dangerous!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.990
I've never heard of little 
girl instinct before.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:53.790
My little girl instinct is...

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:02.230
So, Asuta, tell us what you think?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.590
What? Me?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.500
You're kind of putting me on the spot...

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.010
Really...

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.920
I thought you would know more 
after getting intimate with her.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.290
No matter.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.980
That doesn't count as getting intimate.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.340
Gold Medal 
GJ

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.570
The person who uncovers Robin's identity

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.940
will receive a Venera Medal of Honor!

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.470
I'm expecting to hear some good news soon!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:34.130
May the light of Zvezda 
shine throughout this world!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.620
You want a medal?

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:41.450
I'm having trouble keeping up with those people.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:43.090
Huh?

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.470
Good morning, Komadori-san.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.780
Oh, Asuta-kun.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:52.830
Good morning.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.390
Y-You don't look too good.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.060
Is something wrong?

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:59.500
Yeah, I screwed up at work.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.310
Oh, you have a job?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.800
Keep it a secret!

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.810
Don't tell anyone!

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.560
Don't tell anyone that you have a job?

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.400
Why not?

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:13.180
Don't talk about it anymore!

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:15.190
I won't! I won't!

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.410
It's Miki-sama!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.250
Miki-sama?!

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.540
Good day, everyone.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.160
It's Miki-sama!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.100
She's beautiful as always!

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.280
Huh? Miki-sama?

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.950
She's from the most 
famous family in Santama,

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.380
has good grades and excels at sports,

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:39.810
and is talented at everything!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:42.070
She's Shirasagi Miki-sama!

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.990
Yeah, I know who she is...

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.120
She has such a dazzling smile, too!

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:51.590
I wish I could be like her.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.900
You're fine the way you are.

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:54.600
Huh?

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.200
Er, n-never mind that!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:00.590
You may make mistakes, 
but you're working hard.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.260
And you're even nice to people like me.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:06.670
Plus, watching you helps to cheer me up.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.350
S-So, uh...

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.300
What is that?

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:15.730
This?

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.160
Isn't it cute?

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.190
It's a character I came up 
with called Komadori-kun.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.020
You made it yourself?

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.690
Uh-huh, it's my masterpiece!

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.630
<i>No way...</i>

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.770
<i>You gotta be kidding me...</i>

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.140
We're gonna be late!

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.740
Asuta-kun, let's run!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.500
Renge-chan

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.830
is White Robin?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.340
It's okay. I can handle this.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.100
It's okay. I can handle this.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.090
I can handle this.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.020
<i>Komadori Renge. 
Her grades are above average.</i>

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.470
<i>She struggles in gym class.</i>

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.280
<i>She also struggles in home ec.</i>

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.930
<i>She ranks 27th out of 68 on the list 
of girls boys want to go out with.</i>

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.070
<i>I'd say that she looks like an ordinary girl.</i>

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:19.300
<i>If Renge-chan really is Robin...</i>

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.250
That's not relevant! Calm down, me!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.250
I guess I should eat lunch for now.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.330
Yes, I'm coming.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.850
Hello? You've reached Zvezda.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.100
Oh, Asuta-san.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:44.950
Yes, there's a KuruKuru.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.790
Can you send someone to get it?

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.100
What? "The Married Robots"
 is about to start?

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.900
Who cares about that, Robo—

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:57.890
Nobody's coming.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:58.970
Asuta-kun?

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:05.200
Who were you on the phone with just now?

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.610
A-A co-worker!

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.340
They never listen to me.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.010
Oh, you also have a job?

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:15.390
Th-That's right.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.550
What kind of job?

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:22.440
<i>I can't tell her that I'm helping 
people conquer the world.</i>

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.430
Oh, I know...

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.880
Are you keeping your job a secret, too?

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:29.560
Y-Yes, something like that.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.600
I see...

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:34.690
Don't you think it's exciting 
to have a secret job?

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:38.400
Komadori-san...

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.770
What is your secret job?

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:42.990
I can't tell you.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.170
It won't be secret if I say something.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.410
Of course.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:53.500
You see, I want to change.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.280
I want to become a strong girl 
who can help people in trouble.

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:03.280
If I continue to work hard at my 
current job, I think I can get there.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.680
Am I strange?

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.810
No, you're not.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:12.510
So there must be something 
you want to do, Asuta-kun.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:18.210
I-If I say that I want to conquer 
the world, would you laugh?

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:23.690
Personally, I would want you to stop,

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.180
but I won't laugh.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.740
It's a decision you made for yourself.

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:32.590
Oh, no! I need to get changed!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.930
Changed? Why?

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.330
What are you talking about?

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.090
We have gym next period.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.270
Gym?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.020
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.010
<b>Episode 5                        White Robin in Danger!</b>

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.020
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:50.010
<b>Episode 5                        White Robin in Danger!</b>

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:55.440
One, two... One, two... One, two...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.440
Girls' Locker Room

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:01.260
<i>The plan was to search Renge-chan's 
belongings for a clue,</i>

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:06.050
<i>but do I really want to go inside?</i>

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.290
<i>I could be signing my own death warrant...</i>

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.480
<i>No, wait.</i>

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.380
<i>I have nothing to feel guilty about.</i>

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.290
<i>If Renge-chan is Robin, I have to stop her!</i>

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.570
Of course.

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:27.510
The door's locked.

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.290
That was close.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.180
I almost crossed the line of no return.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.340
You've got skills, KuruKuru.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:45.260
It smells like girls in here.

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:47.780
R-Right!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.330
I need to get this done 
before the girls come back!

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:51.910
Not this one!

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:53.460
Nor this one!

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:56.210
Uh, why is this in here?

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.800
Th-This is Renge-chan's...

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.330
What is it, KuruKuru?

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.960
I'm busy right now.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.250
Crap! If someone sees me in here...

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:21.650
It's over...

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.190
My life is over...

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:30.470
Oh, could you grab that?

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:33.850
Please, it's not like that.

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:42.200
No!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.200
Hey! Stop running!

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:46.590
Why did this happen?!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:50.080
All I did was sneak into the girls' locker 
room, look through their belongings,

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.430
and hid in a locker!

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:54.910
Miki-sama!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.090
Miki-sama, are you hurt?

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:11.200
No. There's nothing to 
worry about, everyone.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:15.240
I just disposed of the pervert.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.830
I-I thought I was dead...

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:21.630
Huh?

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.710
Your perverted actions the 
other day weren't enough,

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.420
so now you've become a peeping tom?

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:32.600
I won't ask you to repent 
for the crimes you have committed.

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.680
I just need you to die right now.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.050
<i>She's totally pissed off!</i>

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:44.070
Sword Arte! Thorny Rose Hell Tour!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.290
Karma Beam!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.840
Hey! Time-out! Time-out! Time-out!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.330
I refuse to wait!

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.960
We have an SOS signal from the KuruKuru.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.560
White Robin is currently

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:11.340
headed towards the reconstruction 
zone behind the station.

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:13.530
As I expected.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:16.600
Everything is going according to plan!

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:25.610
That's as far as you go!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.610
I finally have you cornered.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.630
Are you prepared?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.490
I certainly am.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.630
Wrong, you're the one who's cornered!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:39.580
What?!

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.980
Wait! What is this?!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.390
Why did it grab me?!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:54.980
Hey! Don't try to take advantage 
of the fact that I can't move!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.510
I'm not doing it on purpose!

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:01.650
What the hell?!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.390
Are you surprised, White Light?!

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:07.770
This is the tactical tentacle weapon 
that we excavated from the

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.520
ancient underground ruins in secret.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:10.870
Its name is

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:14.590
Squirmy and Slimy Taro Aktinika!

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:16.770
<b>Zvezda All-Purpose Weapon</b>

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:16.770
<b>Squirmy and Slimy Taro Aktinika!</b>

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:18.870
Hey!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.640
L-Let go of me!

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:24.420
I've had enough!

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:27.800
No, not there!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.680
Indeed, it appears to be working wonders.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:33.480
And what comes next?

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:36.140
I didn't plan that far ahead.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.960
<i>Th-This is bad...</i>

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.540
<i>I need to save Robin before 
I start enjoying this!</i>

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.070
<i>Save Renge-chan!</i>

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.440
Okay, I've made up my mind!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.340
I'm going to record this humiliating

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:49.020
scene and broadcast it to the 
whole world over the Internet!

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:53.070
You'll never dare to oppose us again!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.990
Not that!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:00.870
D-Don't do it!

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.870
S-Stop it!

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.230
Where did you just touch me?!

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.320
Help! Police! The pervert's over here!

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.310
You've got it wrong!

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:11.450
I haven't done anything!

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.610
Slimy Taro!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.270
Y-You idiot!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.730
What are you doing, Dva?!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:48.670
Damn it all to hell!

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:04.920
Crap, oh crap...

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:07.020
I kinda got carried away in the moment.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.720
Who knows what they're gonna say to me...

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.730
Why?

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.140
Why did you save me?

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.550
Aren't we enemies?

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.590
Why did I save you?

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:21.700
<i>Right, if I reveal my true identity now...</i>

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.950
Hell if I'm gonna do that!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.500
What are you babbling about?!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:38.180
The almighty Dva would never raise 
a finger against a woman or child.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.320
Wh-What did you say?!

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.890
<i>I have a feeling that there's 
no turning back now...</i>

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:50.820
Th-This experience should teach you to stop 
playing superhero, lovely little lady.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:53.060
L-Lovely?

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:56.900
I'm grateful that you saved me, but...

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.380
Wait, that wasn't what I meant!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:09.460
Huh?

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:13.850
Who are you?!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:17.080
What about this strap?!

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:23.640
I messed up big time!

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:28.480
W-Wait!

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.420
You won't be as lucky next time!

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:37.190
I didn't do any of this for you!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:44.870
Captain! Captain Robin, are you okay?

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.940
Goddammit!

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:50.970
Ow!

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:56.130
It appears that he'll need 
some harsh punishment today!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.800
I'll take care of it!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:59.380
Yeah, no mercy.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.640
Heads will roll. Heads will roll.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:04.440
Th-They're scaring the 
crap outta me, Chief!

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.310
Try not to die, kid.

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:13.650
The West Udogawa branch has 
nothing of note to report today.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.470
Is that acceptable, Captain Robin?

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:17.980
That's perfect.

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:20.660
Sorry about making you do this for me.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:24.410
No, it's my job as your subordinate.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.700
Say, let's go somewhere 
on the way home today.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:30.130
I need a break, and it's 
no fun when I'm alone.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:33.850
Captain, White Light Rule 11...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.630
Yes, I know.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.220
Members are not allowed to reveal 
their identity to one another.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:44.230
As always, you are quick to shift gears.

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:47.840
I am honored to serve you, Captain Robin.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:51.220
Y-You're embarrassing me.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.830
I couldn't ask for a better superior officer.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.190
You're blindly optimistic,

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.090
tenacious as a cockroach,

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:58.820
have a flat and aerodynamic body,

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.250
and also...

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:02.650
Those don't sound like compliments...

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:08.660
Sometimes, I don't get 
what Egret is thinking...

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.710
Okay, shake it all off!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:19.430
Tentacles...

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:20.660
Tentacles scare me...

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.130
Tentacles scare me...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.870
Good morning, Asuta-kun!

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:29.110
S-Sorry, I didn't think 
I hit you that hard...

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:31.650
I-I'm perfectly fine...

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:32.550
Here.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:34.940
Take my hand.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.250
Did something good happen?

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.410
No, not really.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:46.180
I screwed up again at work yesterday.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.030
You look happy for some reason.

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:50.960
After a good night's sleep, 
I forget all the bad!

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:53.050
That's the secret to staying cheerful.

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:58.020
<i>Komadori-san is Komadori-san after all.</i>

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:05.090
Next time, you won't get away, Dva-san.

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:07.040
Huh? Did you say something?

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.590
Come on now! I didn't say anything!

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:12.300
Ow!

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:51.330
You did it, Kate!

00:23:51.330 --> 00:23:53.990
I knew you could pull it off!

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:55.070
<b>Today's Results</b>

00:23:55.070 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Today's Results 
Back Hip Circle</b>

00:23:56.350 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Conquered</b>

00:23:56.970 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Capture White Robin</b>

00:23:58.390 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Failed</b>

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.420
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:24:00.860 --> 00:24:02.420
My name is Odin.

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:05.420
I never make the same mistake twice.

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:11.480
If I had a time machine, I wouldn't want 
to go back to being an immature student.

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:14.210
It's all about the future. 
I live for the future.

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:18.540
Humans are so easily conquered 
when faced with tentacles.

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:21.600
No need to be depressed, Great One.

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:22.460
It was a fluke.

00:24:22.460 --> 00:24:23.350
That's true.

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:26.440
Yasu, help me regain my confidence.

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:27.250
Er, wait...

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.200
<b>Episode 6            After School Treasure Club (Part 1)</b>

00:24:27.250 --> 00:24:29.700
N-No more!
